  "title": "ieee80211: fix VS SGDSN altitude signedness",
  "description": "As it can be seen in the protocol definition (French law): the altitude is a **signed** int 16\n\nhttps://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/jorf/id/JORFTEXT000039685188\nLine: \"06 Altitude courante aéronef (signée) 2\"\n\nHere is the fix working with a negative altitude:\n![Screenshot_2024-12-13_at_10.52.55](/uploads/9551800c342a4e09c3d8db8642049f2e/Screenshot_2024-12-13_at_10.52.55.png)",
